 P0-4 快照开自动；② AI 腿 auto_move 开真搬的一句话。\n\n恒林 Terminal 跑完四段、对着 README 的\"过闸判据\"逐段核完，把 `最终汇报_给爸.md` 按实填好即可一次性报爸——我这边不再发。"},{"role":"user","content":"。做不了那些，你就列好清单出来，先查笔记里面有没有。要是没有的话，就出去学习看怎么去处理。\n\n知道自己做不了，那真的非常棒，不硬去做我非常开心。那你就继续呗，努力找多几个子代理出去外面调研就好了。先查笔记。\n<turn-context>\n<current-time>2026-10-11 18:16:00 +08:00</current-time>\n<working-directory>/Users/billtse/Desktop/泓家系统/恒林笔记</working-directory>\n\nCurrent tasks and notes:\n- [x] 读转窗口口令，理解上下文\n- [x] 只读盘点①②③（凭据/index.db.bak/50_数据/收件箱/txt编码/git态）\n- [x] 确认沙箱：写~/全EPERM，只写工作目录Desktop暂存副本\n- [x] ①止血 3脚本 + P0-4给爸文案\n- [x] ②骨架 B1青瓷/瓯江卡+B2 dump分层+B3 git+B4双轨定规+B4 capture type补丁\n- [x] ③导数据 01txt编码归一+01b fast版/02收件箱消化/03 safe-push\n- [x] ④检索智能 P1.5影子库+评测/P1.1 AI腿/P2级联去重标签\n- [x] run_all.sh总跑 + README + 最终汇报_给爸.md\n- [x] 全部脚本 bash -n / ast 语法自检过\n- [x] 本会话实跑只读证据：01b干跑(活区txt 563/需转码30)、收件箱盘点(237全在_待人工)、P2去重台账(活区md 4830/52重复组/114冗余)、P1.5评测集生成\n- [x] B4盲跑安全性证明：活文件拷贝跑4段变换+ast.parse通过(段[3]多行return幂等跳过)\n- [x] P1.5评测集20条 expect_kw 活区语料全命中(20/20)\n- [ ] 待恒林Terminal(cd ~)落地①②③④(沙箱EPERM挡住的写操作) → 按README过闸判据逐段进 → 一次性给爸报结果\n\nComplete every TODO update before starting the final user-facing response, and never call a TODO tool after the final response has started.\n\n</turn-context>\nShell 对照测试显示：两个目标目录新建文件即 EPERM（连写入都失败，并非仅 chmod 被锁）；活区文件报 No such file（路径/状态异常）；老文件 stat 显示 flags=0（无 uchg/nouchg 锁）且仅输出到 inode 部分。\n[assistant] (continued):\n\nThe assistant's text response to the tool call was cut off, but the immediate next action was to read another file. Here is the summary of the interaction:\n\nThe assistant read the file `01_survey.sh` located at `/Users/billtse/Desktop/泓家系统/泓记/P0-5_空间止血_落地包/`. The tool returned the contents of a bash script designed to survey disk space usage, specifically checking for large index database backups, browser screenshot/profiles, and build artifacts (node_modules, dist, .pyc) within the project directory.\nA shell command was executed to list the contents of the P0-0, P0-1, and P0-5 landing package directories within the \"泓家系统\" project, and to check the status of `index.db.bak` backup files. The response revealed the specific scripts included in each package (e.g., `chmod`, `patch`, `dryrun`, `survey`) and identified four existing database backup files with their respective sizes and timestamps.\nA shell command was executed to test the writability of several directories: `~/.hongji`, `~/泓记/40_归档`, `~/Desktop/泓家系统`, `~/Desktop`, and the current working directory. The results showed that all directories except the current working directory returned \"Operation not permitted,\" while the current working directory is writable.\nA shell command was executed to run a survey script (01_survey.sh) within the local filesystem to check the size of backup files and various build directories in order to prepare for a cleanup task. The output listed the sizes of several index database backups and noted the presence of code repository build directories.\nA shell command was executed to check the git status of two local directories: ~/hongji-app and ~/泓算. The output indicates that ~/hongji-app is already a git repository, while ~/泓算 is not initialized as a git repository.\n一次 shell 探测运行，批量检查了 B1/B2/B3 涉及目录的写权限并搜索关键位置。结果：`~/泓记` 下所有 B2（50_数据及子目录）和 B3（hongji-app、泓算）目标目录全部 EPERM（沙箱限制不可写）；B1 定位到 `10_项目/安悦韩品` 目录及若干入口相关文件；收件箱主目录为 `/Users/billtse/泓记/00_收件箱`，另有多个同步回收站备份副本。\nA shell command was run to explore the directory structure and find files related to \"入口卡\" (entry card) for the \"安悦韩品\" project. This involved listing the directory tree, grepping for files containing the keyword \"入口卡\", and checking the gitignore and git log for the `hongji-app` repository. The output showed the files in the project directory that contain the keyword \"入口卡\", along with the .gitignore contents and the last few git commits for the repository.\nA shell command was executed in the `~/hongji-app` directory to inspect the Git repository's state (version, remotes, tags, branches, and status) and to read the first 60 lines of a shop memory/state card file (`安悦韩品_店铺记忆与状态卡_20260924.md`). The response confirmed Git version 2.54.0, that the current branch is `main`, and that there are modified/untracked files (`scripts/zspace_sync.py` is modified; `scripts/memory_isolate.py` and `scripts/memory_registry.json` are untracked). The response also included the full content of the shop memory card, detailing operational redlines, current status, inventory issues, and historical discrepancies for the \"An Yue Han Pin\" shop. Note: Several `git` commands produced `Operation not permitted` errors related to cache files in `/var/folders/...`, but the relevant status information was still retrieved.\nA shell command was executed to perform a read-only audit of the 泓记 data structure, specifically checking:\n- The list of shop directories under `10_项目` (identifying 青瓷运营 and others)\n- The count of top-level .md files and sample listings in `青瓷运营` (88 .md files found)\n- The file count in `00_收件箱` (237 files)\n- The distribution of .txt files across directories (total 753, with top clusters in inbox `_待人工/2026-09` (209), `20_领域/股票` (129), and `青瓷运营` (49))\n- The existence of a `50_数据` directory (result: does not exist)\n- The presence of a `type` field in `capture_service.py` (result: only HTML form `type` attributes and HTTP Content-Type headers found, no data model `type` field)"},{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_0a568fd8f2234b40abc7184d","type":"function","function":{"name":"todo__todo_write","arguments":"{\"content\":\"- [x] 落地包四段脚本全部备好 + 语法自检 + 本会话能跑的只读证据(干跑/去重/评测集/B4盲跑证明)\\n- [ ] 列出\\\"沙箱做不了的写操作\\\"清单（根因：Agnes 写 ~/ EPERM）\\n- [ ] 先查笔记：~/泓记 全库 grep 沙箱/TCC/Agnes 写权限/授权 既有经验\\n- [ ] 查 30_资源/Qoder记忆备份 + ~/hongji-app docs 里有没有 Agnes/桌面Agent 权限 SOP\\n- [ ] 没有现成解法→派多个子代理并行外部调研（macOS TCC/Full Disk Access、AgnesCode Full-access 模式、Agent 写家目录免 Terminal 方案）\\n- [ ] 汇总调研→更新落地包/给爸文案/给恒林的可执行结论\"}"}}],"content":"\n\n恒林，方向收到——**做不了的不硬做，先查笔记里有没有现成解法，没有就派子代理出去调研**。我把\"我（沙箱）做不了的\"根因锁定成一件事：Agnes 进程写 `~/` 被 macOS 沙箱挡住（EPERM），导致 ①–④ 的落地写操作我只能备好脚本、不能直接执行。先查笔记里有没有处理过这个。\n\n让我先更新任务，然后一次性 grep 全库（活区 + Qoder 记忆备份）搜相关经验："},{"role":"tool","content":"Updated (352 chars)","tool_call_id":"call_0a568fd8f2234b40abc7184d"},{"role":"user","content":"<turn-context>\n<current-time>2026-10-11 18:16:00 +08:00</current-time>\n<working-directory>/Users/billtse/Desktop/泓家系统/恒林笔记</working-directory>\n\nCurrent tasks and notes:\n- [x] 落地包四段脚本全部备好 + 语法自检 + 本会话能跑的只读证据(干跑/去重/评测集/B4盲跑证明)\n- [ ] 列出\"沙箱做不了的写操作\"清单（根因：Agnes 写 ~/ EPERM）\n- [ ] 先查笔记：~/泓记 全库 grep 沙箱/TCC/Agnes 写权限/授权 既有经验\n- [ ] 查 30_资源/Qoder记忆备份 + ~/hongji-app docs 里有没有 Agnes/桌面Agent 权限 SOP\n- [ ] 没有现成解法→派多个子代理并行外部调研（macOS TCC/Full Disk Access、AgnesCode Full-access 模式、Agent 写家目录免 Terminal 方案）\n- [ ] 汇总调研→更新落地包/给爸文案/给恒林的可执行结论\n\nComplete every TODO update before starting the final user-facing response, and never call a TODO tool after the final response has started.\n\n</turn-context>"},{"role":"assistant","content":"The previous task was interrupted by the user. Preserve its history and completed work, but do not continue it unless the user explicitly asks to resume it."},{"role":"user","content":"我要知道自己为什么做不了。其他智能体可以做，那你做不了那部分，就让其他智能体帮你去做，那就可以了。我们电脑里面不是还有很多智能体吗？\n<turn-context>\n<current-time>2026-10-11 18:17:00 +08:00</current-time>\n<working-directory>/Users/billtse/Desktop/泓家系统/恒林笔记</working-directory>\n\nCurrent tasks and notes:\n- [x] 落地包四段脚本全部备好 + 语法自检 + 本会话能跑的只读证据(干跑/去重/评测集/B4盲跑证明)\n- [ ] 列出\"沙箱做不了的写操作\"清单（根因：Agnes 写 ~/ EPERM）\n- [ ] 先查笔记：~/泓记 全库 grep 沙箱/TCC/Agnes 写权限/授权 既有经验\n- [ ] 查 30_资源/Qoder记忆备份 + ~/hongji-app docs 里有没有 Agnes/桌面Agent 权限 SOP\n- [ ] 没有现成解法→派多个子代理并行外部调研（macOS TCC/Full Disk Access、AgnesCode Full-access 模式、Agent 写家目录免 Terminal 方案）\n- [ ] 汇总调研→更新落地包/给爸文案/给恒林的可执行结论\n\nComplete every TODO update before starting the final user-facing response, and never call a TODO tool after the final response has started.\n\n</turn-context>\nA shell command was executed to sample and analyze the character encoding of .txt files within the \"泓记\" directory. The results confirmed that the vast majority of active files (492) and archive files (91) use UTF-8 encoding, with smaller counts of us-ascii, iso-8859-1, and binary files present in both sections.\nTwo shell commands were executed to display the contents of `01_dryrun.sh` and `02_push.sh` from the `P0-1_同步重推_落地包` directory. The scripts are Python/bash workflows for a \"safe-push\" synchronization process that generates a dry-run plan to check for credential leaks and then executes the actual push with a receipt verification step.\n通过 shell 工具读取了 `~/Desktop/泓家系统/泓记/capture_service.py`（一个纯标准库实现的快速捕获 HTTP 服务）和 `~/Desktop/泓家系统/泓记/P0-0_凭据收口_落地包/03_gate_and_verify.sh`（P0-0 凭据收口的离线验证脚本）的完整内容。\n测试了 5 个路径的写入权限：沙箱只允许写当前工作目录（`~/Desktop/泓家系统/恒林笔记`，对照组 rc=0），对 `~/泓记`、`~/.hongji`、`~/hongji-app`、`~/Desktop` 等外部路径全部返回 `Operation not permitted`（rc=1）。确认了 Agnes 沙箱无法绕过，只能在工作目录内操作。\nA call to the todo_write tool was made to update the current task list with read-only inventory results, sandbox confirmation, and next steps, successfully updating the list (400 chars).\nA call to shell was made to create the necessary directories for the ①_止血 and ②_骨架 folders under the 落地包_20261011 path.\nI created the first \"① bleeding-stop\" script (01_chmod_600_全库.sh) via a write-tool call; the response confirmed the file was created at /Users/billtse/Desktop/泓家系统/恒林笔记/落地包_20261011/①_止血/01_chmod_600_全库.sh (24 lines).\nA write tool call was made to save a bash script to `/Users/billtse/Desktop/泓家系统/恒林笔记/落地包_20261011/①_止血/02_index_bak_归档.sh` (a space-saving archive script for `~/.hongji/index.db.bak-*` files). The operation succeeded, creating the 40-line file.\nA file named \"03_快照提醒_给爸文案.md\" (containing instructions for a dad to enable automatic snapshots) was written to the specified local desktop directory, and the write operation was confirmed successful.\n② 店铺骨架 B1：shell 调用采集了 青瓷运营 项目的目录结构（含多平台工具链/京东 瓯江官方 等）、md 总数（390）、确认尚未存在店铺状态卡、瓯江天猫工具链文件清单，并读取 00_青瓷电商铁律.md 的前 30 行（含各平台定价铁律及上架前调查要求）。"},{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_c475f46cc6f44e1b9fc7b04f","type":"function","function":{"name":"shell","arguments":"{\"command\":\"echo \\\"===== A. 笔记全库搜既有经验（沙箱/TCC/EPERM/完全磁盘访问/授权）=====\\\"\\ngrep -rln \\\"Operation not permitted\\\\|EPERM\\\\|完全磁盘访问\\\\|Full Disk Access\\\\|TCC\\\" \\\"$HOME/泓记\\\" --include=\\\"*.md\\\" 2>/dev/null | grep -v \\\"40_归档\\\" | head -15\\necho \\\"---- 命中内容抽样 ----\\\"\\ngrep -rh \\\"Operation not permitted\\\\|EPERM\\\\|完全磁盘访问\\\\|Full Disk Access\\\" \\\"$HOME/泓记\\\" --include=\\\"*.md\\\" 2>/dev/null | grep -v \\\"^40_归档\\\" | sort -u | head -12\\necho \\\"\\\"\\necho \\\"===== B. Qoder记忆备份 / 30_资源 里有没有 Agent 权限 SOP =====\\\"\\nls \\\"$HOME/泓记/30_资源\\\" 2>/dev/null\\nfind \\\"$HOME/泓记/30_资源\\\" -iname \\\"*qoder*\\\" -o -iname \\\"*agent*\\\" -o -iname \\\"*授权*\\\" -o -iname \\\"*权限*\\\" 2>/dev/null | head -15\"}"}}],"content":"\n\n先查笔记（全库 + Qoder 记忆备份里搜\"沙箱/TCC/EPERM/权限\"既有经验），同时做只读诊断把\"我为什么做不了\"的根因钉死："},{"role":"tool","content":"===== A. 笔记全库搜既有经验（沙箱/TCC/EPERM/完全磁盘访问/授权）=====\n/Users/billtse/泓记/30_资源/Qoder笔记/02_Qoder-Chats/沙箱环境写入工作区外文件需申请全权限.md\n/Users/billtse/泓记/30_资源/Qoder记忆备份/projects/Users-billtse-Desktop-泓连/common_pitfalls_experience/沙箱环境文件操作权限不足的解决方法.md\n/Users/billtse/泓记/30_资源/Qoder记忆备份/projects/Qoder-Chats/common_pitfalls_experience/宿主_IDE_内不能自杀式关闭_Qoder，osascript_需_TCC_授权.md\n/Users/billtse/泓记/30_资源/Qoder记忆备份/projects/Qoder-Chats/common_pitfalls_experience/沙箱中_ffmpeg_合并音视频文件需申请全权限.md\n/Users/billtse/泓记/30_资源/Qoder记忆备份/projects/Users-billtse-Desktop-泓算/common_pitfalls_experience/macOS_窗口渲染验证盲区：进程活着≠窗口显示.md\n/Users/billtse/泓记/30_资源/Qoder记忆备份/projects/Users-billtse-Desktop-青瓷店铺-青颜青瓷坊 抖店/task_summary_experience/抖店每日两轮红包定时任务落地与根因修复.md\n/Users/billtse/泓记/30_资源/Qoder记忆备份/projects/Users-billtse-Desktop-青瓷店铺-青颜青瓷坊 抖店/task_summary_experience/抖店红包定时任务_TCC_拦截根因排查与修复.md\n/Users/billtse/泓记/30_资源/Qoder记忆备份/projects/Users-billtse-Desktop-青瓷店铺-青颜青瓷坊 抖店/development_practice_specification/直播间红包_crontab_定时脚本实现与_TCC_目录迁移配置.md\n/Users/billtse/泓记/30_资源/Qoder记忆备份/projects/Users-billtse-Desktop-青瓷店铺-青颜青瓷坊 抖店/common_pitfalls_experience/macOS_crontab_定时任务被_TCC_拦截致脚本静默失败.md\n/Users/billtse/泓记/30_资源/软件工具安装记录.md\n/Users/billtse/泓记/10_项目/泓远程/泓远程_使用说明_dump_20260907.md\n/Users/billtse/泓记/10_项目/泓远程/泓远程项目笔记.md\n/Users/billtse/泓记/10_项目/泓节点/恒林浏览器_泓节点交接单.md\n/Users/billtse/泓记/10_项目/泓客/迁移自本地泓客_20261001/14_泓客跨境口径扩展_框架顺序与调研_20260921.md\n/Users/billtse/泓记/10_项目/泓客/迁移自本地泓客_20261001/15_泓客HermesAgent上I9自主运行_现状调研与方案_20260928.md\n---- 命中内容抽样 ----\n    - \"EPERM 错误排查\"\n    - \"Operation not permitted\"\n    - \"在沙箱环境中执行ffmpeg合并音视频时报Operation not permitted\"\n    - \"定位 Operation not permitted 错误根因\"\n    - \"定位 macOS cron Operation not permitted 错误\"\n   - 核查 `/tmp/hb_daily.log` 确认无 `Operation not permitted` 错误。  \n   - 真因 A（TCC/Desktop）：macOS 把 `~/Desktop` 当受保护目录，launchd 派生的 `/usr/bin/python3` 读它下面的 `.py` 直接 `[Errno 1] Operation not permitted`。这就是 `com.honggu.backupwatch` 手工跑正常、launchd 必 `READ_FAIL` 的答案。通道脚本 `hw_i9.py`/`iy9_conn.py` 已收进 `~/hongji-app/scripts`（默认从自己所在目录加载）。launchd 复测：`last exit code = 0`。\n   `Operation not permitted`；而外层 wrapper 一句 `exit 0` 把 rc 吞了 → `last exit code = 0`，于是\"备份看门狗\"\"抖店红包自动发放\"\n   两个选项：① 爸在\"系统设置→隐私与安全性→完全磁盘访问\"里放行（范围大，不推荐）；② 把这套运营自动化从 `~/Desktop/青瓷店铺/` 迁到不受 TCC 保护的目录（它依赖 Desktop 里的 Chrome 配置目录，迁移=高危业务动作，需爸点头 + 一次白天人工盯跑）。\n   最新一轮日志报 `Operation not permitted`（macOS TCC 拦 cron 的 python 读桌面）＝**事实上断更五周**。\n   现行经营数据以店工作区 `tools/wx_daily_check.py` 日报为源；这条老抓数链**要么人工给 python 授完全磁盘访问、要么拍板停用**——属人工/决策项，AI 未擅动。\n  - `~/Library/Containers/com.xunlei.mvideo` 容器受 TCC 保护删不掉（Operation not permitted），仅剩元数据几 KB，不影响使用。\n\n===== B. Qoder记忆备份 / 30_资源 里有没有 Agent 权限 SOP =====\n032018-04-15.xls\n1.时间+辛选商品提报表+供应商名称.xlsx\n1.瓯江旗舰店（天猫）.xlsx\n10.美东奥莱aword（京东）.xlsx\n11.爱上菇aword(京东）.xlsx\n12.上图aword （京东）.xlsx\n123.docx\n13.AI雨神aword (京东）.xlsx\n2.bei2001xuan.xlsx\n2017年  luqin371   月报.xlsx\n2017年双十一工作总结.xlsx\n2018商城小程序（平台版）.pptx\n2018商城小程序（集团版）.ppt\n2018外卖小程序产